#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:4
msgid "v2.9.0"
msgstr "v2.9.0"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.9.0 teaches the IDE to decode the new firmware pixel-format encoding, "
"adds Arduino Nicla Vision support, and brings a set of command-line launch "
"options for headless and kiosk-style deployments. The release stays on the "
"Qt Creator 4.0.2 base. There is one user-facing behavior change to note: the"
" default tab-navigation shortcuts were corrected to the conventional "
"direction, so the next/previous-tab actions are now swapped relative to "
"prior releases."
msgstr ""
"v2.9.0은 IDE가 새로운 펌웨어 픽셀 포맷 인코딩을 디코딩하도록 가르치고, Arduino Nicla Vision 지원을 추가하며, "
"헤드리스 및 키오스크 스타일 배포를 위한 명령줄 시작 옵션 세트를 제공합니다. 이 릴리스는 Qt Creator 4.0.2 기반을 "
"유지합니다. 주목할 사용자 대상 동작 변경이 하나 있습니다. 기본 탭 탐색 단축키가 일반적인 방향으로 수정되어, 다음/이전 탭 동작이 "
"이전 릴리스 대비 서로 바뀌었습니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "이 페이지에서"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "주요 사항"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**New pixel-format decoding** adds live framebuffer and recorded-file "
"support for **PNG**, **Bayer**, and **YUV422** images alongside the existing"
" JPEG, RGB565, Grayscale, and Binary formats, auto-selected based on "
"firmware version."
msgstr ""
"**새로운 픽셀 포맷 디코딩**\\ 은 기존 JPEG, RGB565, Grayscale, Binary 포맷과 함께 **PNG**\\ , "
"**Bayer**\\ , **YUV422** 이미지에 대한 라이브 프레임 버퍼 및 녹화 파일 지원을 추가하며, 펌웨어 버전에 따라 자동 "
"선택됩니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nicla Vision** is now fully supported, including connect and "
"bootloader detection, bundled firmware, and DFU board mappings."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nicla Vision**\\ 이 이제 연결 및 부트로더 감지, 번들 펌웨어, DFU 보드 매핑을 포함하여 완전히 "
"지원됩니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Command-line launch options** (``-auto_connect``, ``-auto_run``, "
"``-full_screen``, ``-list_ports``, ``-serial_number_filter``) enable "
"headless and kiosk-style startup."
msgstr ""
"**명령줄 실행 옵션** (\\ ``-auto_connect``\\ , ``-auto_run``\\ , ``-full_screen``\\"
" , ``-list_ports``\\ , ``-serial_number_filter``\\ )으로 헤드리스 및 키오스크 방식의 시작이 "
"가능합니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Arduino touch-to-reset** opens Portenta and Nicla boards at 1200 baud to "
"reset into the bootloader before reconnecting."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino 터치 투 리셋**\\ 은 재연결하기 전에 부트로더로 리셋하기 위해 Portenta 및 Nicla 보드를 1200 보드 "
"레이트로 엽니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Bundled OpenMV camera firmware** updated to **4.2.3** across all boards."
msgstr "**번들 OpenMV 카메라 펌웨어**\\ 가 모든 보드 전반에 걸쳐 **4.2.3**\\ 으로 업데이트되었습니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:36
msgid "New features"
msgstr "새로운 기능"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:38
msgid ""
"New **command-line launch options** let the IDE auto-connect to the first "
"board, auto-run the opened script, and start in full-screen mode via "
"``-auto_connect``, ``-auto_run``, and ``-full_screen``; the firmware-upgrade"
" prompt is suppressed when auto-connecting (`bd866e3b2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bd866e3b2>`__)."
msgstr ""
"새로운 **명령줄 시작 옵션**\\ 을 통해 IDE가 ``-auto_connect``\\ , ``-auto_run``\\ , "
"``-full_screen``\\ 으로 첫 번째 보드에 자동 연결하고, 열린 스크립트를 자동 실행하며, 전체 화면 모드로 시작할 수 "
"있습니다. 자동 연결 시 펌웨어 업그레이드 프롬프트는 억제됩니다 (\\ `bd866e3b2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bd866e3b2>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:43
msgid ""
"Added ``-list_ports`` to print detected OpenMV and Arduino camera serial "
"ports, and ``-serial_number_filter`` to restrict detection to a specific "
"board serial number (`b2068ea1e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b2068ea1e>`__)."
msgstr ""
"감지된 OpenMV 및 Arduino 카메라 시리얼 포트를 출력하는 ``-list_ports``\\ 와, 감지를 특정 보드 시리얼 번호로"
" 제한하는 ``-serial_number_filter``\\ 를 추가했습니다 (\\ `b2068ea1e "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b2068ea1e>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:47
msgid ""
"Added **Arduino touch-to-reset**, which opens Portenta and Nicla boards at "
"1200 baud to trigger a reset into the bootloader before reconnecting "
"(`0ac3c75af <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/0ac3c75af>`__)."
msgstr ""
"재연결하기 전에 부트로더로 리셋을 트리거하기 위해 Portenta 및 Nicla 보드를 1200 보드 레이트로 여는 **Arduino "
"터치 투 리셋**\\ 을 추가했습니다 (\\ `0ac3c75af <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/0ac3c75af>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:50
msgid ""
"Added keyboard shortcuts ``Ctrl+Shift+L`` to run the bootloader (load "
"firmware) and ``Ctrl+Shift+E`` to erase onboard data flash (`d8b84ce61 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d8b84ce61>`__)."
msgstr ""
"부트로더 실행(펌웨어 로드)을 위한 ``Ctrl+Shift+L``\\ 과 온보드 데이터 플래시 지우기를 위한 "
"``Ctrl+Shift+E`` 키보드 단축키를 추가했습니다 (\\ `d8b84ce61 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d8b84ce61>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:53
msgid ""
"Added a **TensorFlow Lite object detection** example demonstrating "
"``net.detect()`` to locate and box multiple objects per class, alongside "
"updates to the person-detection examples (`3041c966d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3041c966d>`__)."
msgstr ""
"클래스당 여러 객체를 찾아 박스로 표시하기 위해 ``net.detect()``\\ 를 시연하는 **TensorFlow Lite 객체 "
"검출** 예제를 사람 검출 예제 업데이트와 함께 추가했습니다 (\\ `3041c966d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3041c966d>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"Added **FrogEye2020** event-camera examples (basic and with-tracking) "
"showing the 320x240 two-bit-per-pixel motion sensor running at 50 FPS with a"
" color palette overlay (`623fedcec <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/623fedcec>`__)."
msgstr ""
"색상 팔레트 오버레이와 함께 50 FPS로 실행되는 320x240 픽셀당 2비트 모션 센서를 보여주는 **FrogEye2020** 이벤트"
" 카메라 예제(기본 및 추적 포함)를 추가했습니다 (\\ `623fedcec <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/623fedcec>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:61
msgid ""
"Added **RTSP video server** examples in LAN and WLAN variants for OpenMV and"
" Portenta-H7, replacing the single prior ``rtsp_video_server`` example "
"(`623fedcec <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/623fedcec>`__)."
msgstr ""
"이전의 단일 ``rtsp_video_server`` 예제를 대체하여 OpenMV 및 Portenta-H7용 LAN 및 WLAN 변형의 "
"**RTSP 비디오 서버** 예제를 추가했습니다 (\\ `623fedcec <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/623fedcec>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:64
msgid ""
"Added an **LSM6DSOX IMU Machine Learning Core (MLC)** example for the "
"Arduino Nano RP2040 that loads STMicroelectronics UCF models and runs in "
"interrupt mode (`623fedcec <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/623fedcec>`__)."
msgstr ""
"STMicroelectronics UCF 모델을 로드하고 인터럽트 모드로 실행되는 Arduino Nano RP2040용 "
"**LSM6DSOX IMU 머신러닝 코어(MLC)** 예제를 추가했습니다 (\\ `623fedcec "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/623fedcec>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:70
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "기타 변경 및 개선 사항"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:72
msgid ""
"The IDE now decodes the new firmware **pixel-format encoding**, adding live "
"framebuffer and recorded-file support for PNG, Bayer, and YUV422 images "
"alongside the existing JPEG, RGB565, Grayscale, and Binary formats, auto-"
"selected based on firmware version (`8f1ed1e82 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8f1ed1e82>`__, `1feb603db "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1feb603db>`__)."
msgstr ""
"IDE가 이제 새로운 펌웨어 **픽셀 포맷 인코딩**\\ 을 디코딩하여, 기존 JPEG, RGB565, Grayscale, Binary "
"포맷과 함께 PNG, Bayer, YUV422 이미지에 대한 라이브 프레임 버퍼 및 녹화 파일 지원을 추가하며, 펌웨어 버전에 따라 자동"
" 선택됩니다 (\\ `8f1ed1e82 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8f1ed1e82>`__\\ , `1feb603db <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/1feb603db>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:78
msgid ""
"The Help menu's **About OpenMV Cam** item became a submenu offering per-"
"board pinout diagrams (H7 Plus, H7, M7, M4, M4 Original) (`04bc508ac "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/04bc508ac>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Help 메뉴의 **About OpenMV Cam** 항목이 보드별 핀아웃 다이어그램(H7 Plus, H7, M7, M4, M4 "
"Original)을 제공하는 하위 메뉴가 되었습니다 (\\ `04bc508ac <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/04bc508ac>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Tab navigation shortcuts** were changed to the conventional direction "
"(``Ctrl+PageUp`` selects the previous tab, ``Ctrl+PageDown`` the next, with "
"matching ``Ctrl+Shift+PageUp``/``Ctrl+Shift+PageDown`` move-tab bindings), "
"and the ``Ctrl+Alt+number`` tab-select shortcuts were disabled (`04bc508ac "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/04bc508ac>`__, `f87a2598b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f87a2598b>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**탭 탐색 단축키**\\ 가 일반적인 방향으로 변경되었습니다(\\ ``Ctrl+PageUp``\\ 은 이전 탭을, "
"``Ctrl+PageDown``\\ 은 다음 탭을 선택하며, 이에 맞는 ``Ctrl+Shift+PageUp``\\ /\\ "
"``Ctrl+Shift+PageDown`` 탭 이동 바인딩 포함). 그리고 ``Ctrl+Alt+number`` 탭 선택 단축키가 "
"비활성화되었습니다 (\\ `04bc508ac <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/04bc508ac>`__\\ , `f87a2598b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f87a2598b>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:87
msgid ""
"Refreshed bundled examples: the **CAN** example uses the corrected "
"``sample_point`` argument, the WiFi-shield firmware-update example points at"
" WINC1500 firmware 19.7.6, and the ``imageio_memory`` recording example uses"
" ``sensor.RGB565`` and the new ``read(pause=True)`` playback API (`1bf9f4015"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1bf9f4015>`__, `7ab03b5da "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7ab03b5da>`__)."
msgstr ""
"번들 예제를 새로 고쳤습니다. **CAN** 예제는 수정된 ``sample_point`` 인자를 사용하고, WiFi 실드 펌웨어 업데이트"
" 예제는 WINC1500 펌웨어 19.7.6을 가리키며, ``imageio_memory`` 녹화 예제는 "
"``sensor.RGB565``\\ 와 새로운 ``read(pause=True)`` 재생 API를 사용합니다 (\\ `1bf9f4015 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1bf9f4015>`__\\ , `7ab03b5da "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7ab03b5da>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:93
msgid ""
"Refreshed assorted bundled examples including WiFi scan and AP-mode scripts,"
" image-transfer and popular-features remote-device examples, and the audio "
"FFT and MJPEG streamer AP examples (`623fedcec "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/623fedcec>`__, `9f56381d8 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9f56381d8>`__)."
msgstr ""
"WiFi 스캔 및 AP 모드 스크립트, 이미지 전송 및 인기 기능 원격 장치 예제, 오디오 FFT 및 MJPEG 스트리머 AP 예제를 "
"포함한 다양한 번들 예제를 새로 고쳤습니다 (\\ `623fedcec <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/623fedcec>`__\\ , `9f56381d8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9f56381d8>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:100
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:102
msgid ""
"Fixed the framebuffer and layout splitter sliders jumping when the window is"
" minimized or maximized by persisting splitter state on the main window hide"
" event (`6e526403f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6e526403f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"메인 창 숨김 이벤트에서 스플리터 상태를 유지하여 창이 최소화되거나 최대화될 때 프레임 버퍼 및 레이아웃 스플리터 슬라이더가 튀는 문제를"
" 수정했습니다 (\\ `6e526403f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/6e526403f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:106
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash in firmware-update board name mapping for the legacy NANO33 "
"and PICO (M0) bootloader paths (`47ab8523a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/47ab8523a>`__)."
msgstr ""
"레거시 NANO33 및 PICO(M0) 부트로더 경로에 대한 펌웨어 업데이트 보드 이름 매핑의 크래시를 수정했습니다 (\\ "
"`47ab8523a <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/47ab8523a>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:109
msgid ""
"Increased serial guard timing by 100ms around script start and stop to make "
"starting and stopping scripts more reliable (`9981b8679 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9981b8679>`__)."
msgstr ""
"스크립트 시작 및 중지를 더 안정적으로 만들기 위해 스크립트 시작과 중지 전후의 시리얼 가드 타이밍을 100ms 늘렸습니다 (\\ "
"`9981b8679 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9981b8679>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:114
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "플랫폼 및 도구 지원"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:116
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 기반:** 4.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:117
msgid ""
"Added full support for the **Arduino Nicla Vision** board, including connect"
" and bootloader detection, a bundled NICLAV firmware and UVC firmware "
"directory, and DFU board mappings (`813101874 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/813101874>`__, `629a760aa <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/629a760aa>`__)."
msgstr ""
"연결 및 부트로더 감지, 번들 NICLAV 펌웨어 및 UVC 펌웨어 디렉터리, DFU 보드 매핑을 포함하여 **Arduino Nicla "
"Vision** 보드에 대한 완전한 지원을 추가했습니다 (\\ `813101874 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/813101874>`__\\ , `629a760aa <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/629a760aa>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:122
msgid ""
"Added board detection for the **MT9V0X2-C**, **MT9V0X4-C**, and **HM0360** "
"camera sensors (`b2068ea1e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b2068ea1e>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**MT9V0X2-C**\\ , **MT9V0X4-C**\\ , **HM0360** 카메라 센서에 대한 보드 감지를 추가했습니다 (\\ "
"`b2068ea1e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b2068ea1e>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:125
msgid ""
"Added the **MT9V0X2/MT9V0X4** global-shutter sensor chip IDs, replacing the "
"old single MT9V034 mapping, so the IDE recognizes the updated sensor "
"variants (`bf0bbd7b4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/bf0bbd7b4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"기존의 단일 MT9V034 매핑을 대체하여 **MT9V0X2/MT9V0X4** 글로벌 셔터 센서 칩 ID를 추가하여 IDE가 업데이트된 "
"센서 변형을 인식하도록 했습니다 (\\ `bf0bbd7b4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/bf0bbd7b4>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.9.0.rst:129
msgid ""
"Added detection for the **LEPTON** thermal sensor sub-variants (LEPTON-1.0, "
"-1.5, -2.0, -2.5, -3.0, -3.5) in ``sensors.txt`` (`d0f5a2c05 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d0f5a2c05>`__)."
msgstr ""
"``sensors.txt``\\ 에 **LEPTON** 열화상 센서 하위 변형(LEPTON-1.0, -1.5, -2.0, -2.5, "
